OL,3,GNEWSAAthlete hopes to finish Ironman
OL,4,Aafter brain injury
OL,5,
OL,6,FA visually impaired athlete who had to
OL,7,Frelearn to walk and swim after falling
OL,8,Fdown a flight of stairs is hoping to
OL,9,Fcomplete his first Ironman since the
OL,10,Faccident.
OL,12,FRob Sears, 45, from Norwich, started
OL,13,Fcompeting in para-triathlons in 2017
OL,14,Fdue to progressively losing his
OL,15,Feyesight.
OL,17,FLast July, he fell down a flight of
OL,18,Fstairs which caused a bleed on the
OL,19,Fbrain and fractures to his back and
OL,20,Fpelvis. He had to learn "how to do
OL,21,Feverything from scratch".
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
