OL,3,GNEWSAAthlete hopes to finish Ironman
OL,4,Aafter brain injury
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It completely changed my mindset that
OL,7,Flife is very short and I don't want to
OL,8,Fwaste time complaining about the
OL,9,Fproblems I have," he said.
